"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Thirty pioneer families have arrived in an area due to a wave of nationalism encouraged by Israel's government. This quick change has made nearby Palestinian residents worried.\",            \"english_title\": \"Pioneer Families Arrive\",            \"translated_version\": \"Treinta familias pioneras llegaron a un lugar por una ola de nacionalismo apoyada por el gobierno de Israel. Este cambio r\u00e1pido ha preocupado a los residentes palestinos cercanos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Llegan Familias Pioneras\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 130 people, including 23 children, were hurt when a shopping center was hit. One suspect is in custody, but the police have not shared why it happened.\",            \"english_title\": \"Shopping Center Incident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 130 personas, incluyendo 23 ni\u00f1os, resultaron heridas cuando un centro comercial fue golpeado. Un sospechoso est\u00e1 detenido, pero la polic\u00eda no ha dicho por qu\u00e9 pas\u00f3.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incidente en Centro Comercial\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"About half of the 2,500 deaths from Ebola occurred in the last 20 days, according to the World Health Organization.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ebola Deaths Increase\",            \"translated_version\": \"Aproximadamente la mitad de las 2,500 muertes por \u00e9bola ocurrieron en los \u00faltimos 20 d\u00edas, seg\u00fan la Organizaci\u00f3n Mundial de la Salud.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Aumentan Muertes por \u00c9bola\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Three activists were accused of encouraging others to challenge state power under a law introduced by China.\",            \"english_title\": \"Activists Accused\",            \"translated_version\": \"Tres activistas fueron acusados de animar a otros a desafiar el poder del estado bajo una ley introducida por China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Acusan a Activistas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"German intelligence thinks guns found last year were meant for assassinations for Moscow, according to reports.\",            \"english_title\": \"Guns for Assassinations\",            \"translated_version\": \"La inteligencia alemana cree que las armas encontradas el a\u00f1o pasado eran para asesinatos para Mosc\u00fa, seg\u00fan informes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Armas para Asesinatos\"        }    ]}"